  "stage_ignores": [
    {"what":"write:$IRTX","at":"heartbeat_after_busy_drop","why":"DIVERGENCE: the stage does not model the S57 IR callouts (F479 pins them as presentation only: `_onIrCallout` is in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED). A dying engine sends the kill-confirm and DOWN words over `$IRTX` from inside `_death`; the stage sends nothing."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,6,2,120,120,10,2,*","at":"heartbeat_after_busy_drop","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the respawn flash 1.0 s after `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with the revive write, so the two `$HLED` frames land at different checkpoints. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$IRTX","at":"heartbeat_after_line_sent","why":"DIVERGENCE: the stage does not model the S57 IR callouts (F479 pins them as presentation only: `_onIrCallout` is in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED). A dying engine sends the kill-confirm and DOWN words over `$IRTX` from inside `_death`; the stage sends nothing."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,6,2,120,120,10,2,*","at":"heartbeat_after_line_sent","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the respawn flash 1.0 s after `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with the revive write, so the two `$HLED` frames land at different checkpoints. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$GLED","why":"Harness timing: the stage's gun-body readout animation runs on its injected `sleep`, which is instant in this runner, while the engine's runs on its tick clock, so the same frames land at different checkpoints."},
    {"what":"write:$PLAY,,4,6,N101","at":"heartbeat_after_heal_drop","why":"Harness preamble: the runner's gun answers the stage's divergence poll after its `$LCD` has zeroed the gun's shield (see this trace's `state.shield` note at `live`), so the stage's shield breaks inside its preamble. The break cue (N101) and the heartbeat (N74) after it then sound at other times than on the engine. Not an audio-model gap: test_stage_mirror.py `test_break_heartbeat_refill_online_is_the_whole_cycle` pins the cycle."},
    {"what":"state.moment","why":"The stage has no HUD moment slot to expose as state (its `_moment` is an internal gate); the HUD reads the engine's."},
    {"what":"state.deaths","why":"The stage keeps no death count (MC and the HUD read the engine's); `alive` is compared instead."},
    {"what":"state.shield","at":"live","why":"DIVERGENCE: at the preamble the engine already holds the spawn fill (shield at its ceiling) while the stage reads 0 until the fill echo is matched, so the two fill models disagree on when the pool shows."},
    {"what":"state.phase","why":"The stage has no MC link, so it has no match phase; it is armed and spawned by its own buttons."}
  ],
